%N A126516 Number of base 21 n-digit numbers with adjacent digits differing by four or less.
%C A126516 [Empirical] a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+9^(n-1) for base>=4n-3; a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+9^(n-1)-2 when base=4n-4
%H A126516 Rafał Wiktorowicz, <a href="/A126371/a126371_1.pdf">Proofs of the conjectured recurrences and generating functions for the adjacent-digits family</a>, 2026.
%H A126516 <a href="/index/Rec#order_10">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (13,-32,-72,148,93,-190,-35,85,0,-9).
%o A126516 (S/R) stvar $[N]:(0..M-1) init $[]:=0 asgn $[]->{*} kill +[i in 0..N-2](($[i]`-$[i+1]`>4)+($[i+1]`-$[i]`>4))
%Y A126516 Cf. Base 21 differing by three or less A126489, two or less A126408, one or less A126375.
%K A126516 nonn,base
%O A126516 0,2
%A A126516 _R. H. Hardin_, Dec 28 2006
